:seed: iva-year-2025
@step Seed an opening compensation balance for a first Modelo 303 period. This refuses once an already-filed 303 has consumed the basis, so it is a display frame.
@static aeat app modelo iva-wallet seed --filing-year 2024 --period 4T --amount 0 --confirm
@blocked sandbox-posture Refuses in this page's sandbox: the 2024 4T opening balance is already recorded, and the filed Modelo 303 for 2025 1T has consumed it.
@step Read the balance the local Modelo 303 history carries. Every 2025 quarter's own result was positive, so none generated a quota a compensar, and the zero-amount 2024 4T seed itself carries no balance: the wallet holds no lot.
@result aeat --format json app modelo iva-wallet balance --as-of-year 2025
@expect result.total_balance == "0"
@expect result.active_balance == "0"
@expect result.lot_count == 0
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Fix a wrong seed. This refuses once an already-filed 303 has consumed the basis, so it is a display frame.
@static aeat app modelo iva-wallet correct --filing-year 2024 --period 4T --amount 1200.50 --reason "fix opening balance" --confirm
@blocked sandbox-posture Refuses in this page's sandbox: "an already-filed Modelo 303 (2025/1T) has consumed this seeded compensation basis. Changing it would alter a filed return."
@step Review the AEAT-side compensation history (a live read).
@static aeat app live iva-wallet pull-history --from-year 2024 --to-year 2025
@blocked live-aeat The app live group reads the operator's authenticated AEAT sede session.
